data: {"text":"1. My client M/s Chotanagpur Construction Co. is a reputed construction company engaged in the business of civil"}

data: {"text":" construction works including road construction, building construction and infrastructure development projects"}

data: {"text":" across Jharkhand State. My client has been successfully executing various government contracts with"}

data: {"text":" impeccable track record and has maintained highest standards of workmanship and timely completion of projects"}

data: {"text":" entrusted to them.\n\n2. My client was awarded the contract for road widening and resurfacing of Ranchi-Khunti Road (SH-4) vide Work Order No. JRCD/"}

data: {"text":"RAN/2025/042 dated 20.08.2025 for a contract value of Rs. 1,85,00,000/- (Rupees One Crore Eighty Five"}

data: {"text":" Lakh only). The said work order was issued by your office"}

data: {"text":" and my client accepted the same and commenced the contracted work with"}

data: {"text":" due diligence and in accordance with the specifications and timelines mentioned therein.\n\n3. My client diligently executed"}

data: {"text":" the entire contracted work as per the approved plans, specifications"}

data: {"text":" and quality parameters and completed all contracted work by 15.01.2026,"}

data: {"text":" well within the stipulated time frame. Upon completion, my client submitted the"}

data: {"text":" final running bills along with measurement books which were duly verified and certified by the site engineer appointed by your department, confir"}

data: {"text":"ming the satisfactory completion of the work as per contract specifications.\n\n4. Despite the satisfactory completion of work"}

data: {"text":" and submission of all requisite documents, my client has made repeated representations to your office seeking release"}

data: {"text":" of the outstanding final payment. The representations were made vide letters dated 10.02.2026, 15.03.2026"}

data: {"text":", and 25.04.2026, copies of which are available on record. However, no positive"}

data: {"text":" response has been received from your end nor has any clarification been sought regarding the delay"}

data: {"text":" in payment.\n\n5. The final payment of Rs. 62,30,000/- (Rupees Sixty Two Lakh Thirty Thousand only) remains outstanding since"}

data: {"text":" 15.01.2026, which constitutes a substantial amount due and payable to my client as per the terms and conditions of the work"}

data: {"text":" order. The wrongful withholding of the said amount has caused severe financial hardship to my client who has outstanding vendor liabilities and"}

data: {"text":" is facing difficulties in meeting their business obligations due to non-payment of legitimate dues."}

data: {"text":"\n\n6. It is pertinent to mention that Section 80 of the Code of Civil Procedure, 1"}

data: {"text":"908 mandates that no suit shall be instituted against the Government or any"}

data: {"text":" public officer in respect of any act purporting to be done by such public officer in his official capacity,"}

data: {"text":" until the expiration of two months next after notice in writing has been delivered"}

data: {"text":" to or left at the office of such Government or public officer.\n\n7. In compliance with the af"}

data: {"text":"oresaid mandatory provision, this legal notice is being served upon you to"}

data: {"text":" provide an opportunity to settle the matter amicably before resorting to legal proceedings. The with"}

data: {"text":"holding of legitimate dues without any justifiable reason constitutes breach"}

data: {"text":" of contractual obligations and amounts to causing wrongful loss to my client.\n\n8. NOTICE is"}

data: {"text":" hereby served upon you to release the outstanding final payment of Rs. 62,30,000/- along with applicable interest as per contract"}

data: {"text":" terms within a period of sixty (60) days from the receipt of this notice, failing which my"}

data: {"text":" client shall be constrained to initiate appropriate legal proceedings for recovery of the said amount along with interest"}

data: {"text":", damages and costs, without any further reference"}

data: {"text":" to you."}

